# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
._*

# Editor noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Temporary and working files
*.tmp
~$*
.~lock.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials — belt and braces.
# The real rule is in CLAUDE.md §10: never write a credential to a file here.
# These patterns are a safety net, not permission to try.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*
*secret*
*password*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large binaries — commit a pointer file instead. See assets/README.md.
# Remove a specific exception below if a small file genuinely belongs in the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.wav
*.zip
*.psd
*.ai
*.indd
*.sketch
*.fig
